[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11404.19, "timestamp": "03:10:04", "text": "我喝很多酒，吃很多东西，那可不好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11407.75, "timestamp": "03:10:07", "text": "很好，是的，那很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11410.51, "timestamp": "03:10:10", "text": "确实，我觉得我现在就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11412.429, "timestamp": "03:10:12", "text": "感觉就像某种创新方式，我觉得自己……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11425.389, "timestamp": "03:10:25", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11428.269, "timestamp": "03:10:28", "text": "我在喝那瓶旧酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11430.349, "timestamp": "03:10:30", "text": "今晚哦我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11433.99, "timestamp": "03:10:33", "text": "天哪，我觉得我收不回这件事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11437.63, "timestamp": "03:10:37", "text": "家更像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11441.349, "timestamp": "03:10:41", "text": "呃，我想把它拿回去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11459.95, "timestamp": "03:10:59", "text": "我就站在……"}]